# Ensure binary files are not converted to text.
.exe binary .vga binary .obj binary 

# Set the default behavior, in case people don't have core.autocrlfset set.
* text=auto

# The play-by-mail file that the pbmfix script fixes. Its CR LF line ends, each one doubled, are
# what pbmfix is for, so git keeps its bytes as they are (tests/README.md, "Scripts written by hand").
tests/data/scenarios/SAVEGAME.PBM -text